Cognate with {{cog|stq|rukje|t=to move, shift}}, {{cog|fy|rokje|t=to cause, bring about, incite}}, obsolete {{cog|nl|rokken|t=to cause to move, stir}}, {{cog|frm|rocquer|t=to rock (a baby)}}, {{cog|nds|rucken|t=to twitch, jerk, jolt, flinch}}, {{cog|gmh|rocken|t=to drag, jerk}}, Early Modern {{cog|de|rocken|t=to wiggle, wag}}, Modern {{cog|de|rücken|t=to move, shift}}, {{cog|is|rukka|t=to yank}}, {{cog|enm|ricchen|t=to pull, jerk, move, arrange}}; also {{cog|la|runco|runcāre|t=to weed}}, {{cog|lv|rũķēt|t=to toss, dig}}.

