# A [[circular]] [[frill#Noun|frill]] or [[ruffle#Noun|ruffle]] on a [[garment]], ''especially'' a [[starched#Adjective|starched]], [[fluted#Adjective|fluted]] frill at the [[neck#Noun|neck]] in [[Elizabethan]] and [[Jacobean]] [[England]] (1560s–1620s).
