===Etymology===
From {{suffix|la|rōdō|trum|alt1=rōd(ō)|gloss1=to gnaw}}, from {{der|la|ine-pro|*Hreh₃d-}} + {{m|ine-pro|*-trom}}. Originally a bird's beak or animal's snout, but later extended to objects with a similar shape.

